#: data/io.github.lloura.DuelPy.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Duel! is a modern GNOME game implementing the Rock, Paper, Scissors, Lizard, "
"Spock variant popularized by The Big Bang Theory."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.lloura.DuelPy.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid ""
"Built with GTK4 and Libadwaita, it provides a clean and intuitive interface "
"following GNOME's design guidelines. Challenge the computer and see if you "
"can master all five moves!"
msgstr ""

